                                "example_id": "59f56496-b5ff-41cc-988c-6f5086aaea56",
                                "sense_id": "6ea4635a-cdb7-3722-b517-01b3289ab7cf",
                                "text": "Das normale Endometrium wird durch Längs- und Querfalten in kleine, aneinanderliegende Schleimhautquader unterteilt und bekommt dadurch ein ähnliches Aussehen wie die Oberfläche eines Maiskolbens….",
                                "translation": "The normal endometrium is subdivided by longitudinal and transverse folds into small, adjoining, rectangular blocks of mucous membrane, and thus takes on a similar appearance to the surface of a corncob….",
                                "english": "The normal endometrium is subdivided by longitudinal and transverse folds into small, adjoining, rectangular blocks of mucous membrane, and thus takes on a similar appearance to the surface of a corncob…."
